  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is a continuous function satisfying <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of the integral <math><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
