  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Puting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Applying <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;property in <math><mi>I</mi><mo>,</mo></math> we get,</p><p><math><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
